Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun, fun, you're so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, bah, bah, bah, bah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.91,0:01:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.07,0:01:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the real head of the Beast Clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that means Toshiro is... Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you won't object.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you are such good\Nboys, knowing not to overstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the wild dogs who get put down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Hikaru, based on what\NI've heard, you're looking for a mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me you\Nwouldn't mind becoming my pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the heads of our families,\Nno doubt we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.05,0:02:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the five great families\Nwill move towards unification.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.33,0:03:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, guess we're done here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shift gears fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what all's left?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we saved Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Beast Clan's plot, it's\Nnot happening now. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole marriage thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'll root for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still in one piece? Somehow. We managed.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.30,0:03:44.51,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord5\fs60\fax-0.2\frz7.138\3c&H0F1226&\c&HA9CEFF&\fay-0.02\pos(318,158)\frx4\fry354}Taxi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you. Now\Nyou're gonna get the full taste of our
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gratitude we prepared a little\Nsomething modified bloodline increments.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.76,0:04:08.08,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H25&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad2\fscx90\fs55\c&H7E6FF3&\4c&H513668&\3c&H674469&\pos(325,0)}Modi{\alpha&HFF&\t(250,251,\alpha&H00&)}fied {\alpha&HFF&\t(500,501,\alpha&H00&)}Blood{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,751,\alpha&H00&)}line{\alpha&HFF&\t(2080,2081,\alpha&H00&)}+{\alpha&HFF&\t(2830,2831,\alpha&H00&)}+
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little critters,\Nthanksgiving extravaganza!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H7C70F0&\3c&H9DA6F5&\frz36.25\move(-50,110,45,183,30,330)}Little
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H7C70F0&\3c&H9DA6F5&\move(10,-80,140,120,50,550)\frz31.37}Critters
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H7C70F0&\3c&H9DA6F5&\move(240,-65,263,71,600,840)\frz9.876}Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H7C70F0&\3c&H9DA6F5&\frz351.5\move(425,-80,375,71,880,1170)}giving
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.95,0:04:32.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H7C70F0&\3c&H9DA6F5&\frz331.7\move(660,-80,534,139,1750,2100)}Extravaganza
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Re-brand, girl, and become\Nthe cuteness master!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big climax! Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.43,0:05:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Date!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.55,0:05:11.06,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\c&HC0F0FD&\fnVerdana\pos(264,58)\frz9.136}Thanks, Man
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hope this expresses\Njust how grateful we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole ordeal taught\Nme a valuable lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small fry masters like\Nme can put on a nice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,show and that's about it\Nbut that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll still live with my head held high.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome really all of\Nyou are cool as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was at that moment, world-class\Nmarriage swindler, Mei Kinosaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,built the spark between\NGero and Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not letting this\Nopportunity slip by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, who here saw last\Nweek's Twisted Ropes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were also\Na die-hard fan of ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to steer this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of exciting dates, this one\Ntime I went on a private jet ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oil baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within minutes, I've expertly shifted\Nthe conversation to love and romance.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.67,0:06:26.18,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnCourier New\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord2.5\fax-0.02\fs18\3c&H0F1226&\c&HA9CEFF&\pos(156,186)}Taxi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boring subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, you haven't told us\Nwhat your girlfriend is like, Piichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the best there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing her smile gives me the\Ncourage to take on any job and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coming home to dinner with her\Nmakes my exhaustion melt away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I have a day off spending\Nit with her gives me the strength
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to handle the days after I\Nrealize I'm not a decent person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the normal happiness\Nhumans feel that I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aiming for I learned\Nentirely from my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as I live for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For better or for worse,\Nshe's the one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to protect her,\NI would do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piichi Nakagawa, you said that\Nwithout a hint of embarrassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.17,0:07:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of natural charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at Katsunova over\Nhere. Wanna see a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't count on that, but it\Ncertainly turned up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time we talked, because\NArashiyama's head over heels for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But her feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're also a double-edged sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since she idolizes you, if the illusion\Nbreaks, things could end like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be like Ureshino or Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato's grown a lot, so a pep\Ntalk should get him pumped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is play\Nit cool like Piichi did,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when the time's\Nright, get them digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to introduce her to\Nthe new and improved Gato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, we're almost back to shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.79,0:08:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this means goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki-style courting\Narts, bridge builder!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.83,0:08:21.70,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an8\alpha&H25&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad2\fscx90\fs40\c&HF2AFF9&\4c&HA56356&\3c&H512BCE&\pos(325,10)}Kinosaki-style Courting Arts: \NBridge Builder
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure gonna miss you and\Nyour hammies, Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too. I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean she likes me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not pulling my leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would she like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't freeze up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this because I told\Nhim about her feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't even construct a word!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never get her number at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru-Gero, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot, it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better put out this fire and\Ntry to salvage whatever's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I go first, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.47,0:09:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be the one who marries you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.97,0:09:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I overheard you were\Nlooking for a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thought maybe I had a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.39,0:10:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might sound dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel confident about my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm an emotional train wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if by some miracle I got you to accept\Nme, I'd be dependent on you. A burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.89,0:10:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing I would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is totally\Nhalf-assed and self-centered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to build myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I'm crazy independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.05,0:10:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll confess my feelings again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.51,0:10:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.43,0:10:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just did the job I was told to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of being the same little girl who\Nidolized you, I'll become a strong woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind that can support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make you fall for me so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better be ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I sound crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like you,\Nthinking so much about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never once in my whole life has a\Nperson said anything like that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, would it be okay\Nif we exchanged numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, they're a perfect match!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it already!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.70,0:11:52.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\c&H24272A&\frz12.15\fay-0.02\fax0.2\pos(276.66,225.33)\frx8\fry358}Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Added, you're in my\Ncontacts now. Same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:11:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least they're hitting it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to form the perfect marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send my fee with the extra\Ncharges to the designated account.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you miss the payment\Ndeadline, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.95,0:12:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.41,0:12:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she seem mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.89,0:12:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did Piichi leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, honey bunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to be back, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just, group activities\Naren't your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So an overnight on an island with a\Nbunch of strangers sounds a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.29,0:12:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, it was kind of\Nweird at first, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I got along pretty\Nokay with those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, sounds like you\Nended up making new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:13:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, I learned how to\Nprep and cook a giant squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about ink pasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should add it to the cafe's menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's next for you, Arashiyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going into business and\Nstarting my own detective agency.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.42,0:13:19.55,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\frz11.62\move(262,352,262,299)\c&HF6F9F6&}Arashiyama Detective Agency
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.55,0:13:19.67,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\frz11.62\move(262,299,262,292)\c&HF6F9F6&}Arashiyama Detective Agency
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.67,0:13:20.51,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\frz11.62\move(262,292,262,274)\c&HF6F9F6&}Arashiyama Detective Agency
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not the entertainment industry\Nafter that show you put on for us?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.51,0:13:21.01,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\frz11.62\move(262,274,262,271)\c&HF6F9F6&}Arashiyama Detective Agency
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.01,0:13:21.50,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\b1\frz11.62\pos(262,271.34)\c&HF6F9F6&}Arashiyama Detective Agency
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a detective is\Nso much cooler, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I want to find out where\Nmy big brother disappeared to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meow, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's great, but she's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Himekawa, Ureshino too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all beyond amazing, and\Nthey've all been putting the work in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to do the same\Nand be way more charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be a man who's worthy of their love!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll whip you into shape with my\Npatented training of a thousand doormen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Tadawaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's our new poison vat treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it everything you hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nearly died and I've never been better!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, teacher, what can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's concerning Master Hikaru's marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.55,0:15:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me more.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.98,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(315,278)}Thanks{\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}, Man
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got good vibes\Nfrom all three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.27,0:15:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's my boss at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.61,0:15:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy my age from a different school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.63,0:15:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And an underclassman I met\Nat a club in junior high.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could\Npick only one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how I love each of them to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me out, advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your problem
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, now all three of them want to\Ntake me out on a date for my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Romantic counseling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.06,0:15:44.60,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord0\fax-0.21\fay-0.02\fs18\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\move(401.33,98.67,401.33,-169.33)}Mei the Love Evangelist
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.06,0:15:44.60,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord0\fax-0.21\fs14\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\move(354,132.67,354,-135.33)}200k followers
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.06,0:15:44.60,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord0\fax-0.21\fay-0.01\fs14\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\move(338.67,171.33,338.67,-96.67)}309 following
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.06,0:15:44.60,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord1.5\fax-0.21\fs30\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\move(341.33,211.33,341.33,-56.67)}Followers only!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.06,0:15:44.60,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord1\fax-0.21\fs22\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\move(312,317,312,49}Kiss your worries goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May the love evangelist, followers\Nonly, kiss your worries goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time while I'm doing my side hustle,\NI want you to sit in on the sessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My practice to max my charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It went over Himekawa,\NUreshino, and Arashiyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.13,0:16:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The training of a thousand torments!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.46,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord1\fax-0.11\fs22\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\pos(317,52)}Special Guest
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.46,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord1\fax-0.11\fs30\fscx90\3c&HCEC5BB&\c&H010201&\frz352.8\pos(315,74)}The gorgeous guy in the glasses
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.46,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord13\fax-0.11\fs65\fscx90\3c&H463F3C&\c&HD41A5E&\frz352.8\pos(459.33,222)}Hikaru
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.46,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord10\fax-0.11\fs65\fscx90\3c&HC7BDB0&\c&HD41A5E&\frz352.8\pos(459.33,222)}Hikaru
Dialogue: 2,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.46,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\shad0\bord7\fax-0.11\fs65\fscx90\3c&H040102&\c&HD41A5E&\frz352.8\pos(459.33,222)}Hikaru
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.85,0:16:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've endured a hundred already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only nine hundred left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is just a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why don't you triple book so you\Ncan hang out with all three of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.45,0:16:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So about my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let that be the toughest one. Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before school ends, I've gotta\Nask out the team manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only all the other players like her too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no one's feelings for\Nher are stronger than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I score the final\Ntry and win over her heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should build this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For starters, be yourself\Naround her. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be polite. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bathroom's sparkling clean! Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a magic trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.31,0:17:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was my advice good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, break's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I only saw it as a fling,\Nbut now it feels so much more real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since graduating from college,\NI've been swamped with work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't met any nice girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For quite a long time i've been\Nteaching a spanish cooking class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one of my students has my\Nheart dancing a paso double.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah what do you think any feedback on\Nmy song i wrote it for my sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering whether i should ask\Nout this girl we're in the same year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met an older woman on a trip\Ni can't get her out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five years now under the same roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm madly in love with my\NSpanish cooking teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.67,0:18:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can fit in another 20 today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intellectual linguistic\Nenhancer toxin. Silver tongue!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.46,0:18:34.77,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an7\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur5\bord2\shad0\fscx90\fs60\c&H7161F1&\4c&HD2E7FD&\3c&H6D528E&\pos(225,8)}Toxin: Silver Tongue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.39,0:18:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill yourself just to\Nget out of counseling!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admit it, I'm hopeless. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.05,0:18:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody is fighting their own battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I possibly give them the\Nanswers they desperately need?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone has to work as hard as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted you to see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, there are no right answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's doing their best in\Nfiguring out their own situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.03,0:19:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deciding what's best for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.43,0:19:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Arashiyama said she liked you, it\Nwas like you lost all your confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your expression said, I can't accept\Nher feelings the way I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you see, that just proves\Nyou're like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're giving your love\Nlife all you've got, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're on the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.65,0:19:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.57,0:19:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.83,0:20:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the candy kit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rewarding myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.70,0:20:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's really celebrate\Nwith sukiyaki! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've actually got plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.79,0:20:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a rain check?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but you owe me fancy sukiyaki and\Nsushi for the after party, got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.57,0:20:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to say, even since the first\Nday I met you strapped to that chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you agreed to help me by\Nbecoming my marriage advisor,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've been through a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, well, the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what we dealt with, I\Nhad a great time through all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, before I met you, the best\Nthing I had going for me was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DIY candy kits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:20:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll continue guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my search for a bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.87,0:21:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to end up happily married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.97,0:21:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru it's been way too long
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for making time for me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how's the search?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty okay, I guess What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it's going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That advisor must be a miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have a little more faith in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.53,0:21:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, you might have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.87,0:21:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a rumor about\Nthe Gero branch families.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.07,0:22:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up to something.
