Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.66,0:22:16.00,Italics,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,1)\b1\an8\3c&H66B8BE&\shad0\c&H533F98&\fnArial\fs20\i0\pos(448.444,204.222)}Half Price
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.85,0:22:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try. ERS. Ga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye bye. Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.17,0:23:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me.

